<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RUT_Karrobel.xml                       UtinniPatches - COMMISSION_LEDGER_CLEANUP_1

  Resolves ledger slug `the_miasma:delta-loam-composter-castings-producer`
  (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/the_miasma.md §4 "the composters" / §7
  "delta loam"; miasma_fauna_roster_2026-09-23.md row 2, the roster's own
  fully-specified brief: "deep wedge body, front end armoured into a blade
  ... thicker than it is wide, tapering to a hardened wedge-shaped head it
  drives into the muck. Mostly seen half-buried, with only the rear plates
  and a churned ring of castings showing. Plates banded black and rust,
  always caked ... The delta loam is its castings").

  🔴 Working name only, per that roster document's own naming register (not
  an owner ruling) — folded into MIASMA_SHIPPING_NAMES_1, filed this pass,
  same posture as POISONFOREST_SHIPPING_NAMES_1/SCARLANDS_SHIPPING_NAMES_1/
  PROPANELAKES_SHIPPING_NAMES_1 from prior waves of this same item.
  RUT_-tiered (not the roster doc's own prospective RM_Karrobel) because
  this def is wired into RUT_Miasma.xml, which has NOT migrated to a
  standalone mod (checked this pass — no RM_Miasma/mandrake.rm.miasma
  BiomeDef or mod folder exists anywhere in src/), matching the
  RUT_MortuaryCrawler/RUT_FleetFlier precedent from the two prior waves of
  this item: new invented content lands in the tier of the file it is
  wired into, not the tier a design doc prospectively names for a future
  split.

  Body BeetleLikeWithClaw (same body RUT_Emberscythe/RUT_PyrelandsPortedFauna
  already use in this mod set) for the "front end armoured into a blade"
  brief — HeadClaw carries the wedge/blade tool below, Mouth a minor bite,
  no HeadAttackTool needed (this is a composter, not a fighter).

  🔑 Castings mechanism: reuses RM_CompGatherableGas
  (src/RimMandrake/EnvironmentalHazards/Source/RM_CompGatherableGas.cs,
  already built and compiling for FORGE_MECHANICS_1's tibanna tap) rather
  than any new C# — that comp is a generic CompHasGatherableBodyResource
  subclass (gatherIntervalDays/gatherAmount/gatherDef/fullnessLabelKey, all
  it needs), and "an animal periodically yields a harvestable resource" is
  exactly what "its castings are the loam" describes. Attached directly in
  this ThingDef's own <comps> (not a separate patch, unlike RUT_TibannaTap_
  BeldonWiring.xml's PatchOperationFindMod) because RUT_Karrobel is a new
  def this pass owns outright, not a donor def being patched.

  Combat/behaviour: predator false, minimal tools, low wildness, low
  combatPower — the roster's own text never frames this as prey or threat,
  only as a background muck-worker "mostly seen half-buried." foodType
  OmnivoreRoughAnimal (detritivore digesting the sin-soup per the sheet's
  §4 "burrowing muck-workers digesting the sin-soup," not a hunter, not a
  pure herbivore).

  ComfyTemperature 15/55: the_miasma.md's own measured median (42.8 C,
  header §0) plus headroom either side, matching how RUT_MortuaryCrawler/
  RUT_PyrelandsFauna each set their own biome-measured range rather than a
  generic default.

  Population: 🔴 CORRECTED by MIASMA_FAUNA_FLOOR_ROSTER_1, which built the
  other three karr- clade scuttlers (RM_Karravel/RM_Karrimeth/RM_Karrolun,
  src/RimMandrake/Miasma/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/RM_Miasma_ArthropodFloor.xml)
  this pairing was originally deferred for. This def now carries
  RM_CompVerminBreeder + RM_VerminPressureExtension on the same
  populationGroupTag ("RM_MiasmaScuttlers") as all three, so the shared
  RM_MapComponent_VerminPopulation actually tracks one pool across all four
  scuttlers, per the roster's own "one population, four draws on it"
  (miasma_fauna_roster_2026-09-23.md §2) — not three sharing a pool and a
  fourth silently outside it.

  Art: genuinely new, no existing render found (checked infrastructure/
  artpipe/{done,pending,registry.jsonl} for "karrobel"/"composter"/
  "delta loam" first — clean). One facing job filed this pass
  (rutkarrobel_v1_south — the roster's own brief: "mostly seen half-buried,"
  a single low-profile ground pose covers every practical view; east/north
  deferred as optional per that same "mostly buried" framing, same posture
  RUT_Karravel-style mass/carpet creatures in this roster get per §7's own
  "must not be briefed as hero sprites" caution, even though Karrobel
  itself isn't a mass creature — a burrowed animal is rarely seen from
  multiple angles either).
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RUT_Karrobel</defName>
    <label>karrobel</label>
    <description>A thick, wedge-bodied scuttler, tapering to a hardened blade of a head it drives into the muck. Rarely seen whole — mostly it is a churned ring of castings and a pair of banded, mud-caked plates breaking the surface. Where it has worked, the ground turns rich: clean delta loam, cast up from whatever the Miasma's sin-soup was before.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>1.6</MoveSpeed>
      <Mass>6</Mass>
      <MarketValue>45</MarketValue>
      <Wildness>0.25</Wildness>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>15</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>55</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.2</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.1</ArmorRating_Blunt>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>wedge head</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>5</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>HeadClaw</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <chanceFactor>0.6</chanceFactor>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>mandibles</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>4</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Mouth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <race>
      <body>BeetleLikeWithClaw</body>
      <predator>false</predator>
      <baseBodySize>0.5</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>0.8</baseHealthScale>
      <baseHungerRate>0.5</baseHungerRate>
      <foodType>OmnivoreRoughAnimal</foodType>
      <fleshType>Insectoid</fleshType>
      <bloodDef>Filth_BloodInsect</bloodDef>
      <bloodSmearDef>Filth_BloodSmear</bloodSmearDef>
      <meatColor>(150,140,120)</meatColor>
      <meatMarketValue>0.3</meatMarketValue>
      <herdAnimal>false</herdAnimal>
      <roamMtbDays>4</roamMtbDays>
      <trainability>None</trainability>
      <manhunterOnDamageChance>0.02</manhunterOnDamageChance>
      <manhunterOnTameFailChance>0.02</manhunterOnTameFailChance>
      <lifeExpectancy>8</lifeExpectancy>
      <gestationPeriodDays>6</gestationPeriodDays>
      <litterSizeCurve>
        <points>
          <li>(0.5, 0)</li>
          <li>(1, 1)</li>
          <li>(2, 1.2)</li>
          <li>(2.5, 0)</li>
        </points>
      </litterSizeCurve>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalBaby</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.15</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.4</minAge>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <soundMeleeHitPawn>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitPawn</soundMeleeHitPawn>
      <soundMeleeHitBuilding>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitBuilding</soundMeleeHitBuilding>
      <soundMeleeMiss>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_Miss</soundMeleeMiss>
      <soundEating>Insectoid_Eat</soundEating>
    </race>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.CompProperties_GatherableGas" MayRequire="mandrake.rm.environmentalhazards">
        <gatherIntervalDays>3</gatherIntervalDays>
        <gatherAmount>8</gatherAmount>
        <gatherDef>RUT_DeltaLoam</gatherDef>
        <fullnessLabelKey>RUT_DeltaLoamCastings</fullnessLabelKey>
      </li>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.CreatureBehaviors.RM_CompProperties_VerminBreeder" MayRequire="mandrake.rm.creaturebehaviors">
        <pawnSpawnIntervalDays>1.5~3</pawnSpawnIntervalDays>
        <pawnSpawnRadius>3</pawnSpawnRadius>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.CreatureBehaviors.RM_VerminPressureExtension" MayRequire="mandrake.rm.creaturebehaviors">
        <populationSoftCap>40</populationSoftCap>
        <populationHardCap>100</populationHardCap>
        <populationGroupTag>RM_MiasmaScuttlers</populationGroupTag>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>AnimalExotic</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="AnimalKindBase">
    <defName>RUT_Karrobel</defName>
    <label>karrobel</label>
    <race>RUT_Karrobel</race>
    <combatPower>12</combatPower>
    <wildGroupSize>1~3</wildGroupSize>
    <ecoSystemWeight>0.4</ecoSystemWeight>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_Karrobel/RUT_Karrobel</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.7</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_Karrobel/RUT_Karrobel</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.9</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_Karrobel/RUT_Karrobel</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>1.1</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

</Defs>
